      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sashaphmn/starred%7B/owner%7D%7B/repo%7D",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sashaphmn/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sashaphmn/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sashaphmn/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sashaphmn/events%7B/privacy%7D",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sashaphmn/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "While background validation runs after loading an assumeutxo\nsnapshot, blocks needed only by the background (historical) chainstate\nare also tracked in mapBlocksInFlight. The condition that decides\nwhether a new block is requested as a compact block counted those\nblocks as well, so with historical blocks in flight the new block at\nthe tip was requested as a full block instead.\n\nDo not count blocks that are only needed by the historical chainstate.\nCompact block relay then works normally during background validation.\n\nBehavior is unchanged when no snapshot is loaded, because in that case\nthere are no historical blocks to exclude.",
